{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wise man once said, \u201cIf your only goal is to become rich, you will never achieve it without solving a few cases.\u201d Or something like that.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a freshly brewed coffee (never instant!), feed your pet bird, wrap yourself in a cozy blanket, and set out for a tour of the city where you're at home everywhere, and every inconspicuous citizen napping on a bench is your neighbor. Prove your worth to those who've doubted you\u2014and most importantly, yourself. Uncover the secrets scattered around and solve the mysterious case of the Golden Spoon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by both classic point-and-click and modern narrative adventure games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that accept your uniqueness and creative thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of choice is sometimes met with consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the role of a detective with eavesdropping mechanics and a visual clue system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported using public funding by Slovak Arts Council</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280660/extras/ea92d0fd0ae945ba1fb5d75625ebe047.avif?t=1768519876\" width=200 height=73 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3280660?t=1768519876","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3280660?t=1768519876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280660/eb483882d49d8bd6d02d590e99d9e1ed9ed59144/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768519876","capsule_imagev5":"htt